  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.2: Extensible resource manager. What counts as a resource is now open: a loader registry (ResourceManager.RegisterLoader / RegisterStreamLoader / RegisterFallback) replaces the hardcoded type switch, so consumers can load their own types (JSON, config, custom formats) without modifying the engine. Built-in loaders now also cover raw text (string) and raw bytes (byte[]) alongside textures, fonts, sound buffers, sprites and colour palettes. Added non-file sources via streams: GetResource(key, stream) and GetEmbeddedResource(name); EmbeddedResources now routes through the manager. Robustness: GetResource returns a registered fallback on failure (textures and fonts fall back to the embedded defaults) or throws ResourceLoadException with context; added TryGetResource (no throw on a missing/invalid file); Clear and the new Unload(path) dispose native handles; cache keys are normalised to full paths; folder loads skip files that fail instead of aborting.",
